Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Animated IR housing.\NBrutally. Brutally. Brutally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.98,0:00:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Brutally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A smoker's cries. Forgotten by a\Nharsh word. Then let it be so. Upon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,this world I shall rain down tar and\Nash For I am the devil of nicotine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.68,0:01:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cockroaches This floor is covered in trash\NHow could someone even live In this filth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A rotten ball of rice that\Nneeds to soak. Don't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.12,0:01:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,know you have to wash your\Ndishes after using them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.02,0:01:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of\Nbehavior that I can't stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of hells!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that black goop supposed\Nto be soup at some point?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it just move right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I just stepped in something!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was squishy and now\Nit's all over my foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:01:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.36,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the fuck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nyan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.86,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala... da, Claudioe...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nan boné...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nan boné, Nan boné...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanalaho...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.74,0:02:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,On na peter, uh na peter...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Marchantara...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,On na Peter. Hm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We have on it for the Wond Alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayon 0-1!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayon 0-1!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,0-1-0-1! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tip about\Nthis temp agency Yaku score.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When one blows past one cigarette's\Nbudget, one gets to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 82?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You got any work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to the right place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When can you get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Like yesterday, and find me\Nsomething that makes a ton of dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got an opening for\Nsomething this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it pays great, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a simple cleaning job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure anyone can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, 15-minute break,\N15 minutes, everyone can come on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You smell that shit you're covered in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flammable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's no smoking!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know beef over dough, but\Nyou understand that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I really can't\Nstand this fucking job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They work us like crazy, we don't get\Nbreaks, and on top of that, the pay sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, you agree with me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, it sucks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.55,0:05:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Autumn Darter's out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fall's here, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.48,0:05:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The older I get, the faster time flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:05:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You got back in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected you to take a proper vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My new part-time gig starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.48,0:06:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A tasty souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at you. That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Near my parents' house,\Nthere's a famous dorayaki shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just about to put the kettle on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Want a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But, uh, I'm a little tired from the\Ntravel, so I'll take a rain check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting plenty of rest, then. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, was that Yaku just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I\Nhaven't seen her for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She went back home for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Anniversary of her granddad's passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the black hair makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That black hair looks really cute on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if her grandfather\Nwas beast folk too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.62,0:06:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Little red dragonfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Little red dragonfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A little red dragonfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cook you up a side\Ndish for tonight's dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Little red dragonfly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of smokes already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yaku, are you back\Nin town yet or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Got any smokes I can have?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, kitty, kitty, I know you're in\Nhere Can I bum a cig or ten off ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.80,0:07:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta have one to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not turn on a light?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go see your family sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You really should.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Yaniko, how have things been going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, uh, I've been\Nworking here and there, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.70,0:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been fired a whole bunch, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.10,0:08:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Really now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.08,0:08:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be my fave if you\Nhad a lighter. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did I put that lighter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll borrow a few of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I always found it tasted\Ndifferent when lit with a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.16,0:09:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you have a spare one for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.90,0:09:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're the best! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.02,0:09:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get through this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this late already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be home any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi mom, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.64,0:09:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're smoking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:09:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you can't do that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you just letting her\Ndo it mom doesn't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's like this because\Nyou never yell at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess when you promised to quit the\Nother day that was line number 1,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That face won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what that face means.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Like two peas in a pod, no\Nmatter how old they get.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One movie ticket for Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And one for Big Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Movie theaters have assigned\Nseats now. I love it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you reserve my seat so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have cigarettes with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.90,0:10:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now you know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She likes to act strict,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but look at how Imoko's being\Nconsiderate so that you can smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath it all, you can really\Ntell how much she loves her big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need your input, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The average human lifespan\Nis around 80 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if I could\Nsurvive for half of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Toshi, I'm begging you, don't be like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I want to smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I've ever\Nwanted to smoke so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this movie have to have so\Nmany damn scenes where they're smoking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna run to the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaniko, I just want one little puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I will, Aniki, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.58,0:11:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One last run.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I love a good cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,cry during a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate you\Nguys coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,When all of my friends
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,found out this was a Yakuza movie,\Nthey had other things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you two being weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've got mom smelling\Nlike a gross ashtray too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even know how to be considerate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I like being\Nautomatically blamed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're playing the victim game now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:11:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What I don't understand is\Nhow you can't Sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish moments like\Nthese could last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's talk about\Nyour recent health checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit concerning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The nurse told me your convulsions\Nmade it difficult to draw blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,which tells me we're\Ndealing with alcoholism.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only are your AST\Nlevels highly elevated,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the score is the inverse\Nof your current GPA.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a\Ntextbook example of a slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've heard all this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the drinking and get back in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, you won't see your\Ngraduation, but your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your funeral. Your funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was after quitting\Nfor a whole week already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, not watching where you're\Ngoing is a good way to get hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I should go easy on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She looks like she's in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you trying to get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to walk you\Nhome if you need me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the same way to\Nget to Yanni's apartment
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a problem with school?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.14,0:13:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when I was around your age,\NI got bullied in school too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a lot, but I remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Boys would hide my things\Nlike my shoes and recorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd call me names like Cat Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, during middle school graduation,\Nthe head bully confessed something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me he did all that\Nstuff because he liked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I went through all that pain\Njust because he had a crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's when I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.78,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a way bigger deal\Nin my head than a real...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That story sounds more like a humble brag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I didn't mean it that way,\Nbut I see how you'd think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.18,0:14:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't intentional, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I do feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My problems aren't as\Nbad as I think they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She kind of reminds me of Yani in a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.46,0:14:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a whole lot of trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is longer than the\Ncredits at the end of a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Aruko, we best\Ncadattled just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're causing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.61,0:15:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that I've got a follow-up\Nappointment coming up from my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, doll, I'm not your mama, but a\Nlittle moderation wouldn't hurt you none.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How long since you had a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A day? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only been an hour. Come on, Aruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Outside of my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a biggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule number one, don't stay indoors!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone into spasm mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.00,0:15:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Desperate times, desperate measures!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, door is stuck and it won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means I'm fucking screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Those girls cannot see me like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's rule number two!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.04,0:16:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the balcony door,\Nround back, and break the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If I've got to choose between\Nembarrassment and broken glass, no contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.94,0:16:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,POKEN! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.78,0:16:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, oh, uh, good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, is that a centaur\Ncostume? Doom, how fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, centaurs don't\Nhave two heads, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this like a Cerberus\Nvariant or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kill me. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I could talk\Nmy way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So today I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, now let's\Njust calm down a sec here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:17:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just at the top of\Nmy head, but I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You were in the middle of banging your\Nbespoke sex doll when the earthquake hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but the doll was in vaginal spasm mode\Nand locked you and your you-know-what in,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so you ran for safety, but you got\Nlocked out and now you're stuck outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna guess by the amount of sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing bullseye\Nmanga artists for the win
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen just hang out in my place\Nuntil the handyman gets here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me go buy you some underwear\NI'll be apologizing for the rest of my life
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to walk that close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yani Neko's movements can be hard to\Nread, so I just had to take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.72,0:17:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, when did I\Nlay down to take a nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You were in my whack-ass dream. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you had turned into a censor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jane Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you wrote something\Nnew you want me to look at?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, actually, it\Nwas a friend who wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't posted any of\Nmy writing on Kakeyome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on what you said last time, I\Ndecided to use a popular plot cliche.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that's all over the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's what my friend decided\Nto do when she heard your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So you wrote a banishment story?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was surprisingly fun, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized following a\Nplot cliche isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's what my friend said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There once was a man\Nwho was a dragon major.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The man had no name,\Nfor he had abandoned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor did he need it as the\Npeople simply called him major.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A dragon major is one of the many vocations\Npracticed by the peoples of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.92,0:18:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a big fan of\Nexposition, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with this kind of lore so\Nimportant for the world building?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,About time you got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember you said you wanted\Nto talk about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, kid, I'll be straight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.98,0:19:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You are no longer a\Nmember of our party. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get off of my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this Major dude is supposed\Nto be the main character, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, that's not bad, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the main character\Nthe one doing the banishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it backwards, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I... I... I... Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I know that's not\Nwhat the plot usually goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't want to write the same\Nthing as everyone else on the platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought if I had the\Nmajor do the vanishing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,then the readers would start\Nto question the cliché?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and then there would be even\Nmore value added to the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't read any of the\Ncliché stories on here, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.20,0:19:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.95,0:19:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you ended up here,\Nbut I get that you're in a bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The typhoon blew your tent away,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.80,0:20:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure that makes it\Ntough to live by the river, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.02,0:20:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have family at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone you can reach out to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.30,0:20:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood ties are nothing\Nmore than a concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A way to enforce standards\Nof relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now, that's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like you and I are strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You could even say\Nwe're a family of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel that way about everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Having said that, you can open up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can find a little corner\Nthat I can rent to you super cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I would really appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad we worked that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we grab a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.94,0:20:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there's that wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin, Iora!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry about that. Boner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.68,0:21:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a natural physiological\Nresponse for a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't control it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear! Boner! I can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, we're a family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Family!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Family members shouldn't\Ngive you a raging boner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So, whatever comes off,\Ncomes off, right? You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.74,0:21:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Counting on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.26,0:21:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I barely brushed it, and look at all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it is shedding season, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at how much fur I've brushed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.58,0:21:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like clockwork.\NEvery spring and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how much is coming off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I could make another\NYanni Neko out of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.74,0:21:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.60,0:22:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, every time I'm the person.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The heart, the heart is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always stationary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.40,0:22:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the kind of taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:23:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we so like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.74,0:23:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.68,0:23:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not working or working too?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no people who love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.08,0:24:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
